  {
    "id": "chen-qing-biao",
    "sources": [
      {
        "page": "陳情表 (西晉)",
        "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%83%85%E8%A1%A8_%28%E8%A5%BF%E6%99%89%29",
        "revision": 10482707,
        "revision_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=10482707",
        "parsed_html_sha256": "0ba2949a3d88e07e619a306c76feef3cb77a1935d3f9898a4fed5ff72114bd29"
      }
    ],
    "selection_note": "",
    "start": "臣密言：臣以險釁，夙遭閔凶。生孩六月，慈父見背。行年四歲，舅奪母志。祖",
    "end": "臣不勝犬馬怖懼之情，謹拜表以聞。",
